  {
    "number": 118,
    "title": "docs: synchronize Nanoleaf integration settings delivery",
    "body": "Refs jimmie-potts/codex-nanoleaf#49.\n\nRecord the owner's selection of a Nanoleaf-owned integration settings extension while source implementation is underway. Refresh backlog state and preserve the remaining shared frontend/device acceptance work. This companion will reconcile the actual source merge and issue state before its own final review/merge.\n\nThe extension preserves the depicted native controller, private database and sole worker boundaries. The mode-only MCP interface is unchanged, so existing architecture viewers and their dated review pins remain accurate for their stated scope.\n\nValidation: guide generation, five maintenance tests, six-viewport/print browser checks and committed-output regeneration passed. HTML SHA-256 `265de8ff436162e037e2c1cd4e04169c136a19970e22068bdf462507e5fa6360`. All changes are under docs/work-guide; final guide-only CI filtering evidence and independent Standards/Specification reviews are pending. Public publication and live verification are outside this source delivery.\n",
