  {
    "number": 117,
    "title": "Synchronize Pixoo dashboard renderer delivery in the work guide",
    "body": "Companion to [Pixoo issue #32](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/issues/32) and [PR #63](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/pull/63).\n\nPixoo now has a deterministic four-row 64×64 renderer with exact RGB preview and bounded generation publication. Source PR #63 merged as `9bd99c1b2ec1759cc70eedd5644e585627d3fd25`; all five PR and five main jobs passed, and issue #32 is closed. This refresh records those facts, removes P32 from remaining work, refreshes history and pinned Pixoo sources, and updates the lifecycle viewer. Pixoo #33 retains mode and device-writer integration; #34 retains installed acceptance. Concurrent physical qualification from guide PR #116 is preserved.\n\nGuide validation passed from this candidate: generation, five maintenance tests, desktop/mobile browser checks, diagram interactions, links, print expansion/restoration and PDF generation. Rebuilding committed output produced no drift. The guide contains 12 guides, 101 open issues, 126 linked issues, nine viewers, 49 roadmap nodes and 88 merged PRs. Native/enlarged renderer examples were inspected during source delivery. The changed lifecycle viewer passed all four archify viewport checks and was visually inspected; its SHA-256 is `45e4474163dbfbf9ffcd4ea6bb474bd3583acf1a37890ddc69df0ada37aac6eb`.\n\nGuide HTML SHA-256: `a4115cb82f86330c7d930de2a829238d0f2d20a18383956cc7677697ad230926`, 582516 bytes. Local screenshots, PDF and verification receipt are retained outside Git. One immediately post-closure GitHub refresh returned a closed issue in the open listing; the consistency check rejected it. A complete fresh refresh, build and all checks passed before this commit.\n\nReview comparison: base/merge-base `58a9a3dee78107c13eb1896e1fcd3b540c07b75a`, head `29cb4bc7326f09128856b63285ad65c1802b510f`. Independent Standards and Specification reviews are in progress.\n\nThe established guide-only CI exception applies. The complete comparison below contains only `docs/work-guide/` paths. Both workflows at the candidate exclude that directory for pull requests and main pushes. Current-head GitHub reads show zero runs, zero check runs and zero statuses, with a clean merge state. The aggregate commit status is pending because no statuses exist; there is no pending configured job. Protection/ruleset reads return the documented account-plan 403. No settings changed or checks bypassed. Post-merge tree and push-filter verification remain required.\n\n<details><summary>Complete changed-file list</summary>\n\n```text\nM\tdocs/work-guide/outputs/agent-device-work-guides.html\nM\tdocs/work-guide/outputs/architecture/seq-lifecycle-observation.html\nM\tdocs/work-guide/updates.md\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture/diagram-receipts.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture/rendered/seq-lifecycle-observation.html\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture/source-receipts.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture/sources/divoom-app-upgrade/docs/hub-integration.md\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture/specs/seq-lifecycle-observation.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/architecture_diagrams.py\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/agent-device-hub-prs.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/codex-nanoleaf-issues.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/device-native-deps.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/divoom-app-upgrade-digest.txt\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/divoom-app-upgrade-issues.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/guide-coverage.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/snapshot.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/build_guide.py\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/history/github-history.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/refresh_backlogs.py\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/timeline.py\n```\n</details>\n\nThis updates guide source only. Public publication, installation and physical testing are outside this task.\n",
    "state": "open",
